      <p class="fig"><strong>A note on this edition.</strong> Several widely repeated claims were left out because they could not be traced to a source or were wrong as stated, among them a February date for the CEOs’ letter, findings attributed to a working group that published none, and a “$141 billion” water gap from a 2016 report presented as current. The research behind every line is kept with the site’s source. The same public-domain terms as the site.</p>

